  "subheadline": "Beach mornings, river bridges, and quick road trips.",
  "introduction": "Đà Nẵng is the kind of city that makes travel feel light: sea air in the morning, city lights at night, and enough day-trip options to keep the route open.",
  "shortDescription": "Beach mornings, river bridges, mountain roads, and a clean central base for exploring nearby old towns and coastlines.",
