  "overview": "Đà Nẵng is still my favorite beach city, and probably the place I would choose if I had to settle down somewhere by the sea. A perfect day there is simple: wake up, run around Sơn Trà, eat breakfast, work or sit at a cafe, swim or paddleboard in the afternoon, then walk around the city at night.\n\nThe cost of living is reasonable, the air feels lighter, and life does not need to try too hard to feel good.",
